# 统一换行：仓库内一律 LF，检出也保持 LF。
# 背景：Windows 默认 core.autocrlf=true 会把工作区转成 CRLF，
# 导致 flutter pub get 生成的 generated_* 文件每次都显示 modified，
# 而内容其实一字未变（git diff --ignore-all-space 为空）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 脚本必须保持 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析出错
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
